  "interpretation": "Guardian's local read-only path detected and recovered from the bounded memory pressure in both runs. Beszel's alerts_history remained empty after both configured windows, and a separate idle baseline with a deliberately low 1% threshold also produced no active alert or history record despite the configuration surviving a full page reload. This is evidence that the Beszel alert event path was not observed in this deployment, but it does not identify whether evaluation, agent metric eligibility, or history/notification delivery is responsible. Beszel alert latency cannot be measured until a live event is obtained."
